Subject: [PATCH] Add {{lesson}} outcomes summary to exam review pages

Any page whose title starts with "Exam" now expands {{lesson-name}}
references in its markdown into a 3rd-level heading, the referenced
lesson's Outcomes bullets, and a link to the full lesson page -- see
PageExamOutcomes.ts. This replaces the manual copy-pasted outcome
lists exam2-4.md maintain by hand, and fills in the previously-missing
exam1.md (linked from exam2.md but never created) using the new syntax.

